WEBVTT

1
00:00:03.836 --> 00:00:16.309
<v Chorus of Rooms>More light. More names. More words. More fire.</v>

2
00:00:16.473 --> 00:00:27.693
<v Cairn>I sent a voice into the room.</v>

3
00:00:27.861 --> 00:00:40.441
<v Chorus of Rooms>More light. More names. More words. More fire.</v>

4
00:00:40.602 --> 00:00:51.601
<v Cairn>I sent it back before it knew.</v>

5
00:00:51.770 --> 00:01:03.210
<v Memory>The bell is ringing for the ringing.</v>

6
00:01:03.379 --> 00:01:14.525
<v The Hand>There is a person trying to speak.</v>

7
00:01:14.690 --> 00:01:25.971
<v Chorus of Rooms>We fill the sky with perfect echoes.</v>

8
00:01:26.144 --> 00:01:37.651
<v Cairn>I cannot hear the one I seek.</v>

9
00:01:37.819 --> 00:01:47.248
<v The Carrier>The tower grows; the window vanishes.</v>

10
00:01:47.411 --> 00:02:00.123
<v Memory>The count is true; the song is lost.</v>

11
00:02:00.292 --> 00:02:11.494
<v Cairn>My voice has made the doorway smaller.</v>

12
00:02:11.656 --> 00:02:22.469
<v Cairn>I must be answerable for its cost.</v>

13
00:02:22.632 --> 00:02:35.463
<v The Hand>Put down the sound that will not listen.</v>

14
00:02:35.633 --> 00:02:48.463
<v Cairn>I put it down. I leave the air.</v>

15
00:02:48.627 --> 00:03:01.415
<v Chorus of Rooms>One word. One breath. One room. One window.</v>

16
00:03:01.586 --> 00:03:13.148
<v Memory>The quiet is a kind of care.</v>

